{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 將於 macOS 27.3 測試版為 Mac 版密碼 App 加入自動上鎖時間選項，讓用戶決定無操作多久後上鎖。據程式碼研究者 pdfu 發現，新選單提供 1、3、10 分鐘無操作後上鎖、在 Mac 上鎖或睡眠時上鎖，以及永不自動上鎖等選擇。</p>\n<h2>新選單增自訂上鎖時間</h2>\n<p>目前 macOS 27.2 正式版及更早版本的密碼 App，固定採用 3 分鐘無操作逾時設定。待 12 月更新推出後，用戶將可自行選擇應用程式保持解鎖的時間，毋須依賴預設的 3 分鐘限制。Apple 於 2024 年 9 月隨 macOS Sequoia 推出專用密碼 App，供用戶管理 iCloud 密碼及登入資料。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 Mac 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"740\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/macfamily.jpeg\" width=\"1880\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.774132+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":299,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T14:00:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T17:17:46.381328+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:08.625814+00:00","content_hash":"47463eedae46e1387df8c87014ca6e80d45fb484b27b1259f239ece70cf2eaa2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.774132+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}